# ==========================================
# EmailJS Configuration (Optional)
# ==========================================
# To enable automated contact form delivery directly in the browser:
# 1. Create a free account at https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. Add an Email Service (e.g. Gmail) -> Copy Service ID
# 3. Create an Email Template -> Copy Template ID
# 4. Under Account -> API Keys -> Copy Public Key
# 5. Create a local .env file in the root directory and paste your values below:
#
# VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=service_xxxxxxx
# VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=template_xxxxxxx
# VITE_EMAILJS_ACCESS_TOKEN=public_key_xxxxxxx
#
# If these variables are not set, the contact form will automatically
# open the visitor's mail client (mailto:satyajeetcse17@gmail.com).
